Write a Definition Statement 

I want to build a decentralized application (DApp) where users can stake their ERC20 tokens and earn rewards over time. This platform will provide an easy-to-use
interface for individuals who are looking to invest in cryptocurrency, allowing them to grow their holdings through staking.

Define your Audience: This application is designed for people who are interested in earning passive income through cryptocurrency investments. Specifically, it will cater to crypto enthusiasts, investors, and traders who wish to stake their ERC20 tokens in a secure, transparent, and rewarding environment.

Who is using my application: The users of this platform are crypto investors who seek to leverage the benefits of staking. Whether they are new to staking or experienced investors, this application will offer an accessible and efficient way to earn rewards by locking up their tokens.

