Key Features of the App:
Stake Ethereum: Users can stake their ETH on the platform and start earning rewards.
Rewards Calculation: Users earn rewards based on the amount of ETH staked and the staking duration.
Unstaking: Allows users to withdraw their staked ETH whenever they want (with certain conditions).
Claim Rewards: Users can claim their staking rewards at any time or periodically.
Wallet Integration: Easy integration with popular crypto wallets like MetaMask.
Security: High-level security to protect user funds and personal information.

