What is the purpose of my application?
The purpose this application, Staking Smart, is to provide a platform where users can stake their tokens (specifically, ERC-20 tokens), earn rewards, and have full control over their staking and rewards process.

What business problem or real world problem am I going to be solving?
In essence, Staking Smart is solving the problem of making cryptocurrency staking accessible, secure, and transparent for a broader audience, while also empowering users to earn passive income through the staking process. The app aims to build trust, simplify the user experience, and create a more seamless, engaging platform for crypto investors looking to grow their portfolios.

Define the attributes of your website
The Staking Smart application focuses on simplicity, transparency, and security, while also offering a user-friendly experience for those interested in staking and earning rewards. It’s a platform where users can easily stake ERC-20 tokens, track their rewards in real-time, and receive continuous support and education as they learn about and engage with cryptocurrency staking.

